# Command shapes the token filter never rewrites: one ERE per line, matched against the
# command as written. Tracked defaults; `token-filter verify --apply` and `token-filter skip
# add` write to ~/.agent/token-filter/skip instead. Why each rule exists goes on the line above.
#
# rtk 1.1.0 ls lists directories first and appends sizes: `ls -t | head` returns different
# files, and a short listing grows (verify 2026-11-04: 3 of 3 bad results were ls).
(^|[;&|(] *)ls\b
